<metadata><name>Galičica trail MTB-5</name><desc>MTB-5 is one of Galičica National Park's mountain bike trails, some of them handy links between hiking routes. It's 4.6 km from Gorica to Sv. Blagoveshtenie, with about 172 m of climbing and 56 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 696 m and 859 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/mtb-5/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
